This product serves Google's Google Analytics MCP server, analytics-mcp
(https://github.com/googleanalytics/google-analytics-mcp), Copyright 2025
Google LLC, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Google is not
affiliated with foro.sh, and this server is not a Google product.

What foro.sh changed, without modifying Google's code:

- The server runs in Google's own streamable HTTP mode, read-only (no
  --allow-write), so its write tools are not served (server.py).
- Google sign-in and token refresh are foro.sh's: each tool call gets the
  caller's Google access token from foro's upstream broker (broker.py) instead
  of Application Default Credentials or the server's own OAuth.
